{"artwork_url": "https://i1.sndcdn.com/artworks-000043059944-9zwy8g-large.jpg", "created_at": "2013-03-16T01:01:27Z", "description": "\"TILT Brass - Bowery Poetry Club, August '03\" is the second from the \"SoundCloud Releases (SCR)\" series by Non-Site Records. It presents music from the 2nd concert by TILT's original Brass Band project in August 2003. As did the group's public debut (Non-Site SCR 01), this event took place at the now-defunct East Village venue Bowery Poetry Club. The programing for this show was irreverently \"style-blind,\" encompassing full-ensemble improvisation, pop tune arrangements, and virtuosic concert music. Experimentations of a young, evolving ensemble comprised of world-class, seasoned NYC professionals. Lots of fun listening, enjoy!\r\n\r\nPress Release: http://bit.ly/TILT_BPC_030812\r\nwww.tiltbrass.org | www.tiltbrass.org/tilt-10\r\n\r\nPersonnel:\r\nDave Ballou, Russ Johnson, Jon Nelson - trumpet \r\nGreg Evans, Tom Varner – French horn \r\nCurtis Hasselbring, Christopher McIntyre – trombone \r\nJulie Kalu – bass trombone  \r\nDave Hofstra – tuba  \r\nKevin Norton – percussion\r\n \r\nTILT improvisations\r\nNick Didkovsky - Pascal’s Triangle (1992) (arr. G. Evans)\r\nTom Waits - Coney Island Waltz (2002) (arr. D. Ballou)\r\nTom Waits - Knife Chase (2002) (arr. D. Ballou)\r\nElliott Sharp - SyndaKit (1998)\r\nAFKA Prince - We March (1994) (arr. C. McIntyre)", "duration": 2152685, "embeddable_by": "all", "genre": "Downtown", "id": 4110309, "kind": "playlist", "label_name": "Non-Site Records", "last_modified": "2015-10-13T14:28:09Z", "license": "all-rights-reserved", "likes_count": 2, "managed_by_feeds": false, "permalink": "tilt-brass-bowery-aug03_ns-src02", "permalink_url": "https://soundcloud.com/non-site_records/sets/tilt-brass-bowery-aug03_ns-src02", "public": true, "purchase_title": "Donate to TILT Brass, Inc!", "purchase_url": "https://www.nyfa.org/Donate/Project/12c776f3-b440-4f7b-a0b2-815de1f11ab1", "release_date": "2013-03-1